Docker image build	Build runtime image	2026-11-02T16:34:36.5008351Z               "message": "Scaffold barebone Express + Prisma app (Task 2)\n\nExpress 5 + TypeScript (strict, ESM) with GET /api/v1/health, Prisma 7\nconnected to PostgreSQL via @prisma/adapter-pg, an empty schema (no\nmodels), one Vitest + Supertest test, ESLint, and dev/build/start/test/\nlint scripts. Log the prompt and output as Prompt_test_log.md Entry 1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
