Docker image build	Build runtime image	2026-11-02T16:34:36.5031192Z               "message": "Add multi-stage Dockerfile and docker-compose (Task 3)\n\nThree-stage Dockerfile (build, prod-deps, runtime) on node:24.22.2-slim.\nCompose runs PostgreSQL 17 with a pg_isready healthcheck, a one-shot\nprisma migrate deploy job, and the app, all configured from .env. Log\nthe prompt and output as Prompt_test_log.md Entry 2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
