Docker image build	Build runtime image	2026-11-02T16:34:36.5039873Z               "message": "Add DevSecOps pipeline and SonarQube Cloud config (Task 4)\n\nGitHub Actions workflow on push/PR to main: build/test with coverage,\nDocker image build, Trivy filesystem and image scans, Semgrep, and\nSonarQube Cloud. Scans are non-blocking and publish JSON/SARIF reports\nas artifacts plus a severity table in each job summary. Actions are\npinned to commit SHAs; scanners run from pinned official images. Log\nthe prompt and output as Prompt_test_log.md Entry 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
